  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2961\">\n<li data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2747\">\n<p data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2747\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2660\">Normal EEG:</strong> Symmetrical background activity, no epileptiform discharges, appropriate reactivity.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2860\">\n<p data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2860\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2767\">Abnormal EEG:</strong> Presence of slowing, focal abnormalities, epileptiform discharges, or abnormal reactivity.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2961\">\n<p data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2961\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2897\">Clinical Correlation Required:</strong> EEG findings must be correlated with clinical and imaging data.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
